From: local <local@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] media: i2c: hi846: do not return the runtime PM reference
 count as an error code from .s_ctrl()

hi846_set_ctrl() stores the return value of pm_runtime_get_if_in_use() in
@ret and only checks it for 0 / -EAGAIN.  That helper returns 1 when the
device is already runtime-active (and a reference has just been taken), so
@ret enters the switch() holding 1.  The V4L2_CID_VBLANK and
V4L2_CID_EXPOSURE branches call hi846_write_reg_16(hi846, reg, val, &ret),
which only writes *err on failure and leaves it untouched on success, so a
successful control update returns 1 instead of 0.

__v4l2_ctrl_handler_setup() propagates that 1, hi846_start_streaming()
bails out with "if (ret) return ret" before HI846_REG_MODE_SELECT is ever
written, and .s_stream() reports failure.  The result is that
v4l2_subdev_enable_streams() returns 1 to the capture driver and the
pipeline never starts, with no error message anywhere:

  rockchip-cif fdfe0000.video-capture: enable streams 0:0x1 failed: 1

Keep the PM reference count out of @ret and use <= 0 for the early return.

Signed-off-by: local <local@localhost>
---
diff --git a/drivers/media/i2c/hi846.c b/drivers/media/i2c/hi846.c
index a3f77b8..e231f78 100644
--- a/drivers/media/i2c/hi846.c
+++ b/drivers/media/i2c/hi846.c
@@ -1353,9 +1353,20 @@ static int hi846_set_ctrl(struct v4l2_ctrl *ctrl)
 					 exposure_max);
 	}
 
-	ret = pm_runtime_get_if_in_use(&client->dev);
-	if (!ret || ret == -EAGAIN)
+	/*
+	 * pm_runtime_get_if_in_use() returns 1 when the device is already
+	 * active and a reference has been taken, 0 when it is not in use and
+	 * a negative error code otherwise.  Keep that value out of @ret: from
+	 * here on @ret is the error code of this callback, and the VBLANK and
+	 * EXPOSURE branches below only write it on failure
+	 * (hi846_write_reg_16() leaves @ret untouched on success).  A stale 1
+	 * turns a successful control update into an error, which makes
+	 * __v4l2_ctrl_handler_setup() fail and aborts streaming before the
+	 * sensor is ever switched to streaming mode.
+	 */
+	if (pm_runtime_get_if_in_use(&client->dev) <= 0)
 		return 0;
+	ret = 0;
 
 	switch (ctrl->id) {
 	case V4L2_CID_ANALOGUE_GAIN:
